==County coding==
The order of the numeric county codes used from 1952–61 was based on the populations of each county according to the [[1950 United States census]], and the order of the codes used in 1962 was based on the populations of each county according to the [[1960 United States census|1960 census]],<ref name="allaboutlicenseplatesOK"/> in 2009 county codes were reintroduced on month stickers. As of 2025, both the county abbreviated and the month only abbreviation is currently being used. However, as of 2024, the county abbreviated decal is no longer being issued by the state.
